=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">بٍ و</span>َفَجَّرْنَا فِيهَا مِنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعُي<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٤</span>"},{"id":35,"tajweed":"لِيَأْكُلُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ث</span>َمَرِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> وَمَا عَمِلَتْهُ أَيْدِيهِمْ‌ۖ أَفَلَا يَشْكُر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٥</span>"},{"id":36,"tajweed":"سُ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>حَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِى خَلَقَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَزْو<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>جَ كُلَّهَا مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َا تُ<span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">نۢب</span>ِتُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضُ وَمِنْ أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نف</span>ُسِهِمْ وَمِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َا لَا يَعْلَم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٦</span>"},{"id":37,"tajweed":"وَءَايَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ةٌ ل</span>َّهُمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّيْلُ نَسْلَخُ مِنْهُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َهَارَ فَإِذَا ه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ُّظْلِم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٧</span>"},{"id":38,"tajweed":"وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>شَّمْسُ تَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>رِى لِمُسْتَقَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">رٍّ ل</span>َّهَا‌ۚ ذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>لِكَ تَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>دِيرُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَزِيزِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَل<span class=\"tj tj-madda