s=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦٢</span>"},{"id":63,"tajweed":"هَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ذِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> جَهَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّتِى كُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span>ُمْ تُوعَد<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦٣</span>"},{"id":64,"tajweed":"ٱصْلَوْهَا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْيَوْمَ بِمَا كُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span>ُمْ تَكْفُر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦٤</span>"},{"id":65,"tajweed":"ٱلْيَوْمَ نَخْتِمُ عَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ىٰٓ</span> أَفْو<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>هِهِمْ وَتُكَلِّمُن<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَيْدِيهِمْ وَتَشْهَدُ أَرْجُلُه<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa_shafawi\">ُم ب</span>ِمَا كَانُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> يَكْسِب<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦٥</span>"},{"id":66,"tajweed":"وَلَوْ نَش<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءُ لَطَمَسْنَا عَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ىٰٓ</span> أَعْيُنِهِمْ فَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>سْتَبَقُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>صِّر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>طَ فَأَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َىٰ يُ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>صِر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦٦</span>"},{"id":67,"tajweed":"وَلَوْ نَش<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءُ لَمَسَخْنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هُمْ عَلَىٰ مَكَانَتِهِمْ فَمَا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>سْتَطَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>عُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> مُضِي<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ًّا و</span>َلَا يَرْجِع<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦٧</span>"},{"id":68,"tajweed":"وَم<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ن</span>ُّعَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>ِرْهُ نُنَكِّسْهُ فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْخَلْقِ‌ۖ أَفَلَا يَعْقِل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦٨</span>"},{"id":69,"tajweed":"وَمَا عَلَّمْنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>شِّعْرَ وَمَا يَ<span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">نۢب</span>َغِى لَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ۥٓ‌ۚ</span> إِنْ هُوَ إِلَّا ذِكْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">رٌ و</span>َقُرْءَا<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">نٌ م</span>ُّب<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦٩</span>"},{"id":70,"tajweed":"لِّيُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نذ</span>ِرَ مَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ك</span>َانَ حَي<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ًّا و</span>َيَحِقَّ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقَوْلُ عَلَى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>فِر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٧٠</span>"},{"id":71,"tajweed":"أَوَلَمْ يَرَوْ<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َا خَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>نَا لَه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ِّ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َا عَمِلَتْ أَيْدِين<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَنْعَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span><span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">مًا ف</span>َهُمْ لَهَا مَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>لِك<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٧١</span>"},{"id":72,"tajweed":"وَذَلَّلْنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هَا لَهُمْ فَمِنْهَا رَكُوبُهُمْ وَمِنْهَا يَأْكُل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٧٢</span>"},{"id":73,"tajweed":"وَلَهُمْ فِيهَا مَنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>فِعُ وَمَشَارِبُ‌ۖ أَفَلَا يَشْكُر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٧٣</span>"},{"id":74,"tajweed":"وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>تَّخَذُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن د</span>ُونِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ ءَالِهَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ةً ل</span>َّعَلَّهُمْ يُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نص</span>َر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٧٤</span>"},{"id":75,"tajweed":"لَا يَسْتَطِيعُونَ نَصْرَهُمْ وَهُمْ لَهُمْ جُن<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">دٌ م</span>ُّحْضَر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٧٥</span>"},{"id":76,"tajweed":"فَلَا يَحْزُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نك</span>َ قَوْلُهُمْ‌ۘ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َا نَعْلَمُ مَا يُسِرُّونَ وَمَا يُعْلِن<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٧٦</span>"},{"id":77,"tajweed":"أَوَلَمْ يَرَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْإِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نس</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>نُ أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َا خَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>نَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هُ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ِن ن</span>ُّ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">طْ</span>فَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ةٍ ف</span>َإِذَا هُوَ خَصِي<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">مٌ م</span>ُّب<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٧٧</span>"},{"id":78,"tajweed":"وَضَرَبَ لَنَا مَثَل<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">اً و</span>َنَسِىَ خَلْقَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span>‌ۖ قَالَ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>ُحْىِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعِظَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>مَ وَهِىَ رَم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>مٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٧٨</span>"},{"id":79,"tajweed":"قُلْ يُحْيِيهَا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ِىٓ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نش</span>َأَه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَوَّلَ مَرَّ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ةٍ‌ۖ و</span>َهُوَ بِكُلِّ خَلْقٍ عَل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>مٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٧٩</span>"},{"id":80,"tajweed":"ٱلَّذِى جَعَلَ لَك<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ِّنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>شَّجَرِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَخْضَرِ نَا<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">رًا ف</span>َإِذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span><span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ِّنْهُ تُوقِد<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٨٠</span>"},{"id":81,"tajweed":"أَوَلَيْسَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِى خَلَقَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>و<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>تِ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضَ بِقَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>دِرٍ عَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ىٰٓ</span> أ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>َخْلُقَ مِثْلَه<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa_shafawi\">ُم‌ۚ ب</span>َلَىٰ وَهُوَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْخَلَّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>قُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>مُ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٨١</span>"},{"id":82,"tajweed":"إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَمْرُهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ۥٓ</span> إِذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَرَادَ شَيْــًٔا أ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>َقُولَ لَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> كُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ف</span>َيَك<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نُ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٨٢</span>"},{"id":83,"tajweed":"فَسُ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>حَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِى بِيَدِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> مَلَكُوتُ كُلِّ ش<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َىْءٍ و</span>َإِلَيْهِ تُرْجَع<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٨٣</span>"}]}